     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "More and more",
     "texto": [
      "**Cada vez mais** (more and more): **Cada vez mais pessoas reciclam** (more and more people recycle). Very useful for talking about trends."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In order to, instead of",
     "texto": [
      "**A fim de** + infinitive expresses purpose (in order to): **a fim de poupar energia** (in order to save energy). **Em vez de** + infinitive expresses an alternative (instead of): **em vez de usar carro, andar a pé** (instead of using the car, walking)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sustainability",
     "texto": [
      "**Sustentabilidade** is the balance between environment, economy and society. Note: in Portugal it's written **sustentabilidade** with a single «n»."
     ],
